    rdfs:label "FT_R1_2_M_FundingDefinedInMetadata"^^xsd:string ;vivo:abbreviation "FT_R1_2_M_FundingDefinedInMetadata"^^xsd:string ;dcterms:description """This test evaluates whether the metadata includes explicit details regarding the funding associated with the research object. Specifically, it checks for at least one funder entry within the funding data structure. Expected input is the identifier of the record to be tested.

